.title  Move the camera, or move the world
.what   The view matrix and the projection matrix, by their classical names - and the discovery that a picture cannot tell you whether the cube moved or the camera did, because only where the eye is RELATIVE to the cube decides it
.tier   LESSON
.main   CAM.ASM
.needs  DRAW16.INC SINTAB.INC RECIP.INC
.reads  INFOGR.PAS
.build  FASM CAM.ASM CAM.COM
.run    CAM.COM
.uses   XLATB IMUL CBW NEG SAR LOOP INT
.ignore MAKEINFO.BAT
